    "chunk_text": "Revision of Salaries of the Public Service - 2025\n\nPress briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2025-03-24 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)\n\n- The Cabinet considered the proposals submitted by the Hon. President in his capacity as Minister of Finance, Planning and Economic Development and the Minister of Public Administration, Provincial Councils and Local Government, regarding the issuance of Circular instructions including provisions for the payment of salaries according to the revised salary scales, to be effective from 2025.04.01 based on the proposal submitted by the Hon. President to revise the salaries of the Public Service through the Budget 2025 and decided as follows:\n\n*\tTo authorize the Secretary, Ministry of Public Administration, Provincial Councils and Local Government to issue Circular instructions to all Secretaries to the Ministries, Chief Secretaries of Provinces and Heads of Departments pertaining to the revision of salaries of the Public Service.\n\n*\tto authorize the Secretary of the Ministry of Finance, Planning and Economic Development to issue Circular instructions to State Corporations, Statutory Boards and Fully State-owned Companies and other relevant institutions."
